Build flavor implementation for dual-store deployment

• Implemented Play Store and F-Droid build flavors
• Play Store: ML Kit OCR (smaller APK + runtime download)
• F-Droid: Tesseract OCR (larger APK, fully open source)
• OCR feature available in both builds
• Improved deployment workflow with better error handling
• Fixed scrolling bug on first page when zoomed in.
• Added "Print" feature to PDF viewer menu.
• Improved memory handling for large PDFs and background operations.
• Improved memory and resource handling during app minimization for rotation and page numbering operations.
• Fixed critical Out of Memory crashes when opening large PDFs.
• Fixed App crashing when rapidly converting large images to PDF or heavily watermarking.
• Resolved infinite loading states when loading files over 50MB.
• Optimized storage management by limiting cache bloat from opening multiple files.
• Fixed a crash when repeatedly opening and closing large PDFs.
• Fixed file cache accumulation over time.
